			<id>{7C076143-DCB4-464D-A4F8-A78F5442B110}</id>
			<name>where</name>
			<text><![CDATA[THE CAVE MOUTH IS UP THE HILL, NORTH-EAST OF THE VILLAGE. IF THE SWORD IS ANYWHERE, IT IS AT THE VERY BOTTOM, PAST THE IRON GATES.]]></text>
